    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38824" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπημοιβός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
		late <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Opp.
			<u>H.</u>
			5.135
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crossing,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχῆες ἐ.</span> (unless =
			<i>shifting to and fro</i>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				12.456
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελαμῶνες ἐ.</span>
			<i>cross</i>-belts, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.98
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>alternating, serving for change,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτῶνες ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.513
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστέρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					190
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρηδόνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					365
				</span></i>
			.</div>
